{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_synopsis", "source_sha256": "374e54cc9a49378cb4ae4db02bee3bbb4c2fe7c2914f303012abe77130c8e5ca", "ja": "センター公演が決まりレッスンに張り切る\n響は、ハードワークが過ぎて倒れてしまう。\n反省しつつも、センターに立つ以上は劇場で\n1番のアイドルでありたいと願う響は、倒れ\nない程度に全力を尽くすと誓うのだった。", "zh": "敲定Center公演之后，响一直埋头苦练，\n但她却因为过劳而倒下了。\n在反省的同时，她觉得自己既然是Center，\n那就必须要成为剧场第一的偶像，\n誓言自己会在不影响身体的范围内全力以赴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "439b4d89d47f2458a1ae9a5a6cb06def9666d0d5551cfe085950ad430ce21c0f", "ja": "（響のセンター公演が終わった。圧巻のステージに、\n幕が下りても、会場の熱気が冷める気配はない……）", "zh": "（响的Center公演结束了，在她精彩的表演后即便降下\n舞台帷幕，会场的热烈气氛仍然没有平息的迹象……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "9c3faa442bd92a629e8fae2de526bc12a40755ad4e7d803bf12b402dc6f91964", "ja": "みんなー！　自分のステージ、どうだった？\n自分はね～。……最高だったぞーーー！", "zh": "大家──！本人的表演怎么样啊？\n本人啊……觉得棒透了～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1002_audience", "source_sha256": "b4bd32bb2490546ee3574bdb5ce8ddf7edf3ff89b1f5fca08c1785d41b32ea6c", "ja": "ワァアアアア……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "f8f86cad2d9a9051644dec2ae8f464384d772087bd6bca0d651ab3ff728b9cc9", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとー！　今日の公演は、これで終わり\nだけど。これからも、たくさん公演するからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢大家──！今天的公演虽然就到这边，\n但今后还会有许多的演出喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "ae27f73b4616d91422bfa6917975029072fd5c60535688923f3809b6075f12c4", "ja": "だから、劇場でまた会おう！\n約束さ～！", "zh": "所以，让我们在剧场里再会吧！\n约好啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1005_audience", "source_sha256": "b4bd32bb2490546ee3574bdb5ce8ddf7edf3ff89b1f5fca08c1785d41b32ea6c", "ja": "ワァアアアア……！", "zh": "哗啊啊啊啊啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "0d1ef755779eb4bcced59e666512f4f64e4bc4ce47f87c1ae03cb778762239fc", "ja": "{$P$}、ただいまー！\nどうだった？　自分のセンター公演！", "zh": "{$P$}，本人回来了──！\n本人的Center公演怎么样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6b9ad07c5468ee9923cf5f02737c40c2e1d95fd21120d6e4fd4ba06c3eda8dc1", "ja": "お疲れさま響、よく頑張ったな！\n本当に、いいステージだった！", "zh": "辛苦了，响，你表现得非常棒！\n真的是非常精彩的表演呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "d0424885070ae932790da37c57f4baa8d0328f4891eb12cfe5302eaef176621c", "ja": "響～！　すごいすごいすごいすごいよ～！\nもうサイコー！！", "zh": "响～！好厉害好厉害好厉害好厉害喔～！\n真是太棒了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "da95719442d8680584df65ea5c156a8c3cb2b9c28e66981ef26ddea6ef60fa8b", "ja": "ひびき、すっごくカッコよかったぞ～！", "zh": "响，你超级帅气的喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "781c7b6482f7a4188f900768a6a1a85aa3f5a79eb2b825fac723c7055a4ce5f8", "ja": "ホント、後ろで思わず拍手しそうになっちゃったよ。\n今日は完敗！　マジで最高にクールだった！", "zh": "就是啊，我差点就激动得在后面鼓起掌了。\n今天是我彻底输了！你真的超酷呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "0057fcccb970257dcc96b68ccf6b4b0af951e9adb37aaaec2c653fc089c7bb81", "ja": "くーっ、いいなぁ、カッコよかったなぁ～！\nもうっ、ズルいよ響ばっかり！", "zh": "唔～！好羡慕喔，太帅气了啊～！\n吼～就响一个人帅气太不公平了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "c3050df85e4546f8fbac009a03cd1d5753b6cc417baa634ff2d9abc6f45c1d86", "ja": "ふっふっふ～。言ったでしょ、自分がカンペキな\nステージを見せてあげるって！", "zh": "呵呵呵～本人不是说了吗？\n要让大家瞧瞧什么叫完美的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "88c1113521b8a661fdef50e9ff70080bffacaebd65e0f251175f5b82afc4d7a0", "ja": "でも、自分はまだまだ止まらないぞっ。\nこれからも全力で、どんどん進んでいくからねっ！", "zh": "不过，本人不会这样就满足喔！\n今后也要使尽全力，继续向前冲呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "063405c4b7f8a943349b1eddd1d7a120363ec3bf3080f17c85b980f6aba405c9", "ja": "うう～、私も負けないよっ！　いつかゼッタイ\n追いつくから、待っててね！　あ、待たないでねっ！", "zh": "呜呜～我也不能输！总有一天一定会追上你，\n给我等着！啊，是不要等才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "b6de21bcaea5fb9068307607dfe8729eae961fb374386fc9d574db987dfe95f1", "ja": "たまきも！　今度はたまきがレッドになって、\nひびきにカッコイイって言わせるぞ～！　くふふ♪", "zh": "环也是！下次换环当红色战士，\n一定会让响夸环帅气的喔～！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "4b53c2e97dd2144860b70e1f5e989a6be3bb8b59b2df65b3bd3c1b25da3bac3c", "ja": "ちょっと、アタシを忘れるなって！\nアイ・アム・ナンバーワーン！", "zh": "喂，你们可别忘了我！\nI am No.1！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "8381e401844851c49aa552bd07daa475b3973e91ed180c7bbd7055ab3dfd3577", "ja": "ふふーん。自分をそう簡単に抜けるとは思わない\nでよね！　先頭を走るのは、ずーっと自分だぞ！", "zh": "哼哼～你们可别以为本人有这么好超越！\n本人才是那个一直走在最前端的人喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1018_audience", "source_sha256": "f0505579cb5f3b2480ff0a0479309ebf5f27f5f64584b1961ceb624575ad5934", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "2b2289261ef6a80cabc245c9a832853a68e4d86670a31bc9c4b07d9b18265c99", "ja": "あっ、アンコールだよ。\n響、みんなも行ける？", "zh": "啊，是安可喔。\n响，还有大家都还行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "3f2c5d6a89a47873b6f0a125e545d622a97e83fe4d09ca588775acf6080b6843", "ja": "それじゃ、まずはアンコールのステージで勝負だね！\n私が一番乗りするよーっ☆", "zh": "那么，就用安可表演来一决胜负吧！\n我要冲第一个──☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "8cd207e34cf4af12b6e9ee21e4f6da9872952f25634e13fed8d9c3eb24155dcc", "ja": "うみみ、待って！　たまきも行くー！", "zh": "海美美，等一下！环也要去──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "82d0104270259dca10143a274363754a59107202a3fe3cbb15ec1b9b7c13d41e", "ja": "よーし！　アタシのダンスで熱狂させてやる！\nレッツ・ダンシーング！", "zh": "好──！看我用舞步抓住观众的心！\nLet's dancing！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "abe9664e266c9bdebc02f27338b708163f624c4adb0ca2bfb35732b49348f913", "ja": "ああっ！　自分のセンター公演なのに、\n先に行くなんてズルいぞ～っ！？", "zh": "喂喂！明明是本人的Center公演，\n你们偷跑太奸诈了吧～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "b6f38b21f37df4a4fdcd93892d497ffd0355595f179cc3122cb519eb4f68c11e", "ja": "{$P$}、自分も行ってくるね！\nみんな、待ってよ～！", "zh": "{$P$}，本人也回台上去了！\n各位，等等本人啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c0a6108cf2789b7de1f90a8e09926b8c083da8ed43f62b020e7c4f0e98b74939", "ja": "（響は、楽しそうにステージへ駆けていく。\nアイドルなら、誰もが目指すトップアイドルの座……）", "zh": "（响开心地跑回舞台。\n只要是偶像，无人不向往顶尖的宝座……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_043_1026_p", "source_sha256": "9aca4216aa20a3a872a3ae376b4c3f8002cc076513dfdce77b309b7fd9f486b5", "ja": "（自分が最高に輝ける、そういう場所に向かって。\n仲間たちと一緒に）", "zh": "（与伙伴们一同朝着自己\n最能发光发热的那个地方前进。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
